Hi Vineeth,

I would add that letting people upload arbitrary R programs and
running them could be a security vulnerability.

If the use case is common enough, we could have two sets of primitives
("safe" vs. "unsafe") and have the interpreter disallow unsafe
primitives in certain modes.

