Thanks for taking time to reply to my queries and concerns.

I am excited at the concept of injecting java methods to R using beans.
This way i can move some of the key time taking methods from R implementation to Java implementation.
This will be of great help in our project.

We plan to hit production by this year end and i sincerely hope Renjin would be in a good condition to run in production by then :)

Between pointing the official download to latest successful build in build server doesn't look like a good idea - just my humble opinion.

Thanks
          Vineeth

